          <change when="2024-12-28T14:02:16-05:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/ngonis">Vote - AcceptText - Σαράπιος is not attested as a personal name, and the second letter is epsilon, not alpha. This gives Σερπιο̣ς (there seems to be a trace of omicron). Enter as a (joint) PN correction or discard? (Good to have the BL corrections entered) Next voter?</change>
